.title = "notizine",
.description = "modular multilingual static site starter on zine",
.date = .date("2026-07-01T00:00:00"),
.layout = "index.shtml",
---

**notizine** is a starter for [zine](https://zine-ssg.io). you edit one
cfg file, write markdown, get a fast site with dark mode, instant
search, tags and rss. locales are just folders - two, three, whatever.

**[docs](/notes/)** - everything you need to run your own copy:
install, every config option, module catalog, how content files work,
theming. short pages, no fluff.

**[updates](/updates/)** - the changelog, newest first. what shipped,
what changed, what broke. rss feed attached if you want subs.

this site is built with notizine itself. clone the repo and you're 5
minutes from your own version of it.
